<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>TestFit is a cloud-based computational design platform that combines parametric design with an open marketplace of reusable building blocks. Launched in 2015, it has attracted over 15,000 users who appreciate its unique approach to architectural automation—creating configurable building tools that can be chained together to build complex workflows.</p>
<p>Unlike traditional parametric tools that require deep programming knowledge, TestFit provides a visual interface where architects can combine pre-built "functions" (like space planning algorithms, structural systems, or facade generators) to create custom design solutions. The platform's API-first architecture makes it particularly appealing to tech-savvy firms looking to automate repetitive design tasks.</p>
<p>What makes TestFit stand out is its marketplace model. Developers can create and share building configurators that other architects can use directly in their projects. This creates a growing ecosystem of design intelligence that becomes more valuable over time—similar to how app stores work for mobile platforms.</p>
<div class="testfit-highlight">
<h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Open Marketplace</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">TestFit's marketplace contains dozens of ready-to-use building configurators for everything from parking layouts to MEP routing. Use them as-is or combine them to create custom workflows.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"></path><path d="M9 8h10"></path><path d="M9 14h10"></path><path d="M9 20h10"></path><path d="M3 8l3-3 3 3"></path></svg> Building Configurators</h4><p>Pre-built parametric design tools for common building types. Configure apartment layouts, parking structures, and more through simple interfaces.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>📐 Parametric Design</h4><p>Visual programming environment for creating custom design automation. No coding required for basic workflows, with full API access for advanced users.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/></svg> Cloud Collaboration</h4><p>Fully cloud-based platform enables real-time collaboration. Share configurations and results with team members instantly.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg> Design Automation</h4><p>Automate repetitive design tasks with custom workflows. Chain together multiple functions to create sophisticated design pipelines.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3"/></svg> API Integration</h4><p>RESTful API allows integration with existing tools and custom applications. Build your own interfaces on top of TestFit's geometry engine.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="1" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"></path></svg> Real-time Costing</h4><p>Integrated cost estimation based on design parameters. Understand budget implications as you design, not after.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v6m5.66-16.35l-3.87 3.88m-3.78 3.79l-3.87 3.88m13.52 0l-3.87-3.88m-3.78-3.79l-3.87-3.88"></path></svg> Geometry Engine</h4><p>Powerful cloud-based 3D geometry processing. Handle complex calculations without taxing local hardware resources.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>🛒 Open Marketplace</h4><p>Browse and use community-created configurators. Contribute your own tools and monetize architectural software solutions.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="pros-cons">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"></line></svg> Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-card">
<h3><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg> Advantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Innovative marketplace model</li>
<li>Cloud-based collaboration</li>
<li>No local software installation</li>
<li>API-first architecture</li>
<li>Free tier available</li>
<li>Growing library of configurators</li>
<li>Excellent for automation</li>
<li>Real-time cost estimation</li>
<li>Developer-friendly platform</li>
<li>Active community</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-card">
